type: software

title: "SEED — Smart Trading & Portfolio Analytics Platform"

version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-18"

abstract: >
  SEED is a trading simulation and portfolio analytics platform designed
  to provide a modern financial dashboard experience for portfolio
  tracking, watchlist management, profit and loss analysis, portfolio
  allocation, interactive visualization, and educational investment
  analytics.

